config RADIOMESH
	bool "RadioMesh mesh networking core"
	help
	  Expose the platform-neutral RadioMesh protocol core (the M0 packet
	  slice: RadioMeshPacket, CRC32, and their neutral dependencies) to the
	  Zephyr application. Milestone 1 uses the header-only packet slice, so
	  enabling this only adds the src/ include root; later milestones append
	  compiled neutral sources in zephyr/CMakeLists.txt.
